Surround yourself with a malevolent aura that stores damage you deal.

Whenever you have stored [16, 160, 400, 640, 800 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] damage of one type you unleash a powerful blast at a random enemy dealing [10, 101, 204, 283, 350 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] damage of that type in radius 3 and applying one of the following effects:

Physical:		Slows combat, mind, and spell speed by 20%.

Acid:  Deals [10, 29, 55, 78, 99 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] acid damage each turn for 5 turns ([50, 146, 278, 393, 499 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] total).

Blight:  Deals [1, 5, 10, 15, 20 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] blight damage each turn for 5 turns and reduces strength, constitution, and dexterity by [5, 10, 17, 24, 30 (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)].

Darkness:  Reduces damage dealt by [1%, 7%, 15%, 23%, 30% (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] for 5 turns.

Temporal:  Slows global action speed by [1%, 9%, 20%, 30%, 40% (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)] for 5 turns.

Mind:  Confuses (power [1%, 9%, 20%, 30%, 40% (CUN 10-100; LVL 1-50)]) for 5 turns.

Each effect can only happen once per 10 player turns.  This does not count as a typical cooldown.

The damage and effect power increase with your Cunning, the threshold with your level, and the apply power is the highest of your mind or spell power.
